<title>UK: Tambang Timah at $15.825 in London.</title>
<headline>Tambang Timah at $15.825 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah closed at $15.825 per GDR in London on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of $15.8 and the day's high of $15.925.</p>
<p>It closed at $15.9 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
